OL,3,GNEWSAAnger after Royal Mail fails to   
OL,4,Areplace postbox                        
OL,6,FResidents of a rural village say they  
OL,7,Fare frustrated after being left without
OL,8,Fa postbox for months.                  
OL,10,FPeople in North Huish, near Totnes,    
OL,11,FDevon, said they had been unable to    
OL,12,Fpost letters locally since January when
OL,13,Fthe village's only postbox was removed.
OL,15,FRoyal Mail said the box had been taken 
OL,16,Faway because it was on private land and
OL,17,Fthe company had been unable to find a  
OL,18,Fsafe alternative location.             
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
