OL,3,GNEWSAAnger after Royal Mail fails to   
OL,4,Areplace postbox                        
OL,6,FResident Lesley Ring said she had      
OL,7,Fregularly used the postbox for more    
OL,8,Fthan 30 years. She said many villagers 
OL,9,Fhad to now use a postbox at California 
OL,10,FCross, near Modbury, which was about 3 
OL,11,Fmiles (5km) away.                      
